### Software
{: class="first-heading" id=""}

Here is a list of software projects I am working on, or have worked on in the past.

#### CorA (Corpus Annotator)

CorA is a web-based annotation tool for word-level annotation of historical and
other non-standard language data, implemented in PHP and JavaScript with a MySQL
back-end.  It was originally developed to annotate historical texts for the
[Anselm corpus](http://www.linguistics.rub.de/comphist/projects/anselm/) and the
[reference corpus of Early New High
German](http://www.linguistics.rub.de/comphist/projects/ref/), but has since
been used for a variety of other projects, including the [annotation of social
media data](https://sites.google.com/site/empirist2015/home/shared-task-data).

I am currently actively maintaining CorA as its main developer.

