#### SimpleNLG for German

SimpleNLG for German is an adaption of the [SimpleNLG
library](https://github.com/simplenlg/simplenlg) for natural language
generation, written in Java.  I created it as part of my studies for my master's
degree.  There is a [separate section dedicated to SimpleNLG for
German](simplenlg-ger.html).

